<title>PHILIPPINES: EEI says full yr net seen at 250 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>EEI says full yr net seen at 250 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction and engineering concern EEI Corp said on Thursday it expects its net profit for 1996 to reach 250 million pesos compared with 175.5 million pesos in 1995.</p>
</text>
